Dialogue: 0,0:00:35.23,0:00:39.63,Karaoke Translation op,TITLE,0,0,0,,{\3c&HFFFFFF&\fscx150\fscy120\c&H000000&\move(342,350,318,348,1,4380)}Space Battleship
Dialogue: 0,0:00:34.78,0:00:39.63,yamato,TITLE,0,0,0,,{\c&H0000FF&\fscx347\fscy257\pos(868,926)}Yamato
Dialogue: 0,0:00:35.77,0:00:39.63,Karaoke Translation op,TITLE,0,0,0,,{\3c&HFFFFFF&\fscx167\fscy142\c&H000000&\move(1490,872,1510,886,3,3840)}Soldiers of Love
Dialogue: 0,0:01:43.40,0:01:48.04,def2,SANADA,0,0,0,,When Captain Okita fell ill, I took command.\N Do you remember that ?
Dialogue: 0,0:01:48.48,0:01:49.10,def2,KODAI,0,0,0,,Yes.
Dialogue: 0,0:01:49.70,0:01:56.26,def2,SANADA,0,0,0,,I lost eight crewmen because of my \Ndecision to prioritize rationalism back then.
Dialogue: 0,0:01:57.04,0:01:57.92,def2,KODAI,0,0,0,,Deputy Commander… {If available, use the title from Series 1 for “fukucho (XO / deputy commander etc.)”}
Dialogue: 0,0:01:58.64,0:02:04.88,def2,SANADA,0,0,0,,An analytic mind {rationalistic mind}is the strongest\N weapon, but it has limitations.
Dialogue: 0,0:02:04.88,0:02:06.68,def2,SANADA,0,0,0,,Don’t you think so ?
Dialogue: 0,0:02:06.68,0:02:07.50,def2,KODAI,0,0,0,,That’s…
Dialogue: 0,0:02:08.66,0:02:11.83,def2,SANADA,0,0,0,,Captain Okita’s decisiveness was beyond reason.
Dialogue: 0,0:02:11.83,0:02:16.76,def2,SANADA,0,0,0,,{Yamato}Likewise, only someone who can go beyond\N rationalism is suitable to {be the }command the Yamato.
Dialogue: 0,0:02:18.98,0:02:24.48,def2,SANADA,0,0,0,,Tactical Commander Kodai, I want to entrust command of the ship to you this time.{throughout this trip.}
Dialogue: 0,0:02:25.76,0:02:28.23,def2,SANADA,0,0,0,,I want you to be the acting captain.
Dialogue: 0,0:02:28.23,0:02:31.24,def2,SANADA,0,0,0,,You're the only one who is suitable for the job.
Dialogue: 0,0:03:06.20,0:03:08.82,def2,SERIZAWA,0,0,0,,{It's about time for }Our men should{to} reach the dock any minute now.
Dialogue: 0,0:03:09.54,0:03:15.48,def2,SERIZAWA,0,0,0,,In the worst case scenario, the crew might lock \Nthemselves inside the Yamato with the intention to revolt.
Dialogue: 0,0:03:24.60,0:03:26.44,def2,MAN,0,0,0,,We can't find the Yamato.
Dialogue: 0,0:03:26.44,0:03:29.78,def2,SERIZAWA,0,0,0,,What ? \NThe Yamato is right on our monitor.
Dialogue: 0,0:03:30.84,0:03:32.63,def2,SERIZAWA,0,0,0,,They must have hacked the surveillance camera.
Dialogue: 0,0:03:32.63,0:03:33.70,def2,SERIZAWA,0,0,0,,When did they…
Dialogue: 0,0:03:34.36,0:03:38.16,def2,SERIZAWA,0,0,0,,Check inside the dome.\N Find their location.
Dialogue: 0,0:03:39.08,0:03:41.78,def2,MAN,0,0,0,,No heat signature.\N There's no sign of its departure.
Dialogue: 0,0:03:43.38,0:03:44.63,def2,TODOU,0,0,0,,Underground city…
Dialogue: 0,0:03:44.63,0:03:45.80,def2,SERIZAWA,0,0,0,,What did you just say ?
Dialogue: 0,0:03:46.58,0:03:50.18,def2,TODOU,0,0,0,,The old underground city. \NThe dock is connected to it.
Dialogue: 0,0:03:51.54,0:03:53.78,def2,SERIZAWA,0,0,0,,Give me a visual of the lower tier of the dock.
Dialogue: 0,0:03:53.78,0:03:55.34,def2,MAN,0,0,0,,Cam data on screen.
Dialogue: 0,0:03:57.00,0:03:58.34,def2,SERIZAWA,0,0,0,,Where are they ?
Dialogue: 0,0:03:59.76,0:04:01.26,def2,SERIZAWA,0,0,0,,Damn them…
Dialogue: 0,0:04:01.86,0:04:03.33,def2,TODOU,0,0,0,,Don’t be too rough.
Dialogue: 0,0:04:04.53,0:04:06.88,def2,TODOU,0,0,0,,They're the heroes who saved Earth.
Dialogue: 0,0:04:18.02,0:04:21.78,def2,KODAI,0,0,0,,Captain Okita, I know what to do this time…
Dialogue: 0,0:04:22.50,0:04:24.93,def2,KODAI,0,0,0,,…but I’m afraid…
Dialogue: 0,0:04:24.93,0:04:29.50,def2,KODAI,0,0,0,,…afraid of myself for resorting\N to using the wave motion gun.
Dialogue: 0,0:04:31.46,0:04:34.88,def2,KODAI,0,0,0,,I can still shut down the circuit and disable it.
Dialogue: 0,0:04:35.88,0:04:40.54,def2,KODAI,0,0,0,,{chikyu}That would be the right thing to do since we're leaving Earth in protest against the government's policy.{because we protested \Nagainst the government's policy and are leaving Earth.}
Dialogue: 0,0:04:40.54,0:04:44.70,def2,KODAI,0,0,0,,{demo}But what if I end up losing\N crew members because of it…?
Dialogue: 0,0:04:45.92,0:04:48.90,def2,KODAI,0,0,0,,{sono}What will I do…?
Dialogue: 0,0:04:50.00,0:04:53.28,def2,OKITA,0,0,0,,{\c&HEEEDB8&}Kodai, show your resolve.{hold true to your resolution.}
Dialogue: 0,0:04:54.82,0:04:55.88,def2,KODAI,0,0,0,,Captain !
Dialogue: 0,0:05:11.96,0:05:15.23,def2,WOMAN,0,0,0,,We've detected a ship southwest of the glass dome.
Dialogue: 0,0:05:15.23,0:05:16.44,def2,WOMAN,0,0,0,,It’s the Kirishima.
Dialogue: 0,0:05:16.56,0:05:18.28,def2,SERIZAWA,0,0,0,,W...what ?
Dialogue: 0,0:05:18.28,0:05:20.28,def2,SERIZAWA,0,0,0,,Why is a retired ship…?
Dialogue: 0,0:05:20.28,0:05:21.70,def2,SERIZAWA,0,0,0,,Who's operating it ?
Dialogue: 0,0:05:40.40,0:05:41.68,def2,SHIMA,0,0,0,,It’s begun.
Dialogue: 0,0:05:43.70,0:05:47.78,def2,KODAI,0,0,0,,{\c&HEEEDB8&}We should go, regardless of who\N the person is, or where they are.
Dialogue: 0,0:05:48.66,0:05:52.90,def2,SHIMA,0,0,0,,Is this the only option left, Kodai ?
Dialogue: 0,0:05:57.32,0:05:58.88,def2,MAN,0,0,0,,This way. Hurry.
Dialogue: 0,0:06:13.40,0:06:16.28,def2,SERIZAWA,0,0,0,,They're descending into the old underground city.
Dialogue: 0,0:06:16.28,0:06:17.98,def2,SERIZAWA,0,0,0,,Send our team in there.
Dialogue: 0,0:06:19.26,0:06:23.43,def2,SERIZAWA,0,0,0,,Search throughout the remains of the last great war.
Dialogue: 0,0:06:23.43,0:06:24.52,def2,TODOU,0,0,0,,Serizawa !
Dialogue: 0,0:06:25.92,0:06:30.08,def2,TODOU,0,0,0,,Once all of them are aboard the Yamato, I'll talk to them.
Dialogue: 0,0:06:30.58,0:06:31.16,def2,SERIZAWA,0,0,0,,But…
Dialogue: 0,0:06:31.48,0:06:34.48,def2,TODOU,0,0,0,,Don't make a move.\N I won't allow any killing.
Dialogue: 0,0:06:38.94,0:06:42.84,def2,SERIZAWA,0,0,0,,I understand, but we have to suppress them.
Dialogue: 0,0:06:43.26,0:06:48.80,def2,SERIZAWA,0,0,0,,If they ignore you and try to launch the Yamato, then…
Dialogue: 0,0:06:59.04,0:07:01.32,def2,SADO,0,0,0,,Here they come.
Dialogue: 0,0:07:04.18,0:07:05.88,def2,MAN,0,0,0,,Yamazaki ! {MAN:: Yamazaki.}
Dialogue: 0,0:07:04.63,0:07:05.88,def2,MAN,0,0,0,,{\c&HEEEDB8&}Yamazaki !
Dialogue: 0,0:07:05.88,0:07:09.58,def2,YAMAZAKI,0,0,0,,Kamo, Yoshida, hurry up. Pops is waiting.
Dialogue: 0,0:07:09.58,0:07:09.98,def2,YAMAZAKI,0,0,0,,Yes, sir.
Dialogue: 0,0:07:22.06,0:07:26.42,def2,TOKUGAWA,0,0,0,,We don't have enough time for tuning, \Nand our preparations are inadequate.
Dialogue: 0,0:07:26.98,0:07:29.44,def2,TOKUGAWA,0,0,0,,But we must launch the Yamato no matter what.
Dialogue: 0,0:07:29.44,0:07:30.04,def2,MEN,0,0,0,,Aye, sir.
Dialogue: 0,0:07:32.22,0:07:33.42,def2,NANBU,0,0,0,,The combat satellite…
Dialogue: 0,0:07:34.28,0:07:37.58,def2,SANADA,0,0,0,,If it continues getting closer, \Nthe Yamato will be within range.
Dialogue: 0,0:07:38.20,0:07:39.58,def2,OHTA,0,0,0,,Are they going to use it ?
Dialogue: 0,0:07:40.26,0:07:42.68,def2,SANADA,0,0,0,,We're a ship of rebels.
Dialogue: 0,0:07:42.68,0:07:47.32,def2,TOKUGAWA,0,0,0,,The chamber is warming up, \Nbut the controls are sensitive.{it needs sensitive control.}
Dialogue: 0,0:07:47.68,0:07:49.80,def2,TOKUGAWA,0,0,0,,Ohta, are you ready{going} to steer the ship ?
Dialogue: 0,0:07:50.94,0:07:53.54,def2,TOKUGAWA,0,0,0,,If he was coming, he would be here already.{should have been here already.}
Dialogue: 0,0:07:54.76,0:07:56.52,def2,OHTA,0,0,0,,So, Shima is…
Dialogue: 0,0:07:57.54,0:07:59.56,def2,NANBU,0,0,0,,Every person’s different.
Dialogue: 0,0:07:59.88,0:08:00.88,def2,KODAI,0,0,0,,How is it going ?
Dialogue: 0,0:08:02.56,0:08:05.08,def2,NANBU,0,0,0,,HQ has mobilized the combat satellite.
Dialogue: 0,0:08:05.58,0:08:08.44,def2,AIHARA,0,0,0,,Incoming message from HQ.
Dialogue: 0,0:08:08.92,0:08:10.60,def2,KODAI,0,0,0,,Put it on the main panel.
Dialogue: 0,0:08:12.52,0:08:17.16,def2,TODOU,0,0,0,,{\c&HEEEDB8&}I’m Todou Heikuro, the Chief of the Earth Defense Force.
Dialogue: 0,0:08:18.30,0:08:24.42,def2,TODOU,0,0,0,,{\c&HEEEDB8&}Distinguished crew of the Yamato, who accomplished an unprecedented journey, I want you to listen.
Dialogue: 0,0:08:25.18,0:08:28.10,def2,TODOU,0,0,0,,{\c&HEEEDB8&}We were saved by Iscandar in the past.
Dialogue: 0,0:08:28.10,0:08:29.56,def2,KODAI,0,0,0,,{\pos(966,924)}Broadcast this throughout the ship.
Dialogue: 0,0:08:28.63,0:08:34.78,def2,Todou,0,0,0,,{\c&HEEEDB8&}That’s why you’re convinced that you\N must respond to the voice asking for help.
Dialogue: 0,0:08:29.74,0:08:31.56,def2,Aihara,0,0,0,,{\pos(962,922)}Wha…? Okay. {TODOU:: That’s why you’re convinced that you must respond to the voice which asks for help. }
Dialogue: 0,0:08:35.88,0:08:37.64,def2,TODOU,0,0,0,,{\c&HEEEDB8&}{sono}I understand how you feel.
Dialogue: 0,0:08:38.84,0:08:41.08,def2,TODOU,0,0,0,,{\c&HEEEDB8&}{shikashi}But think about it.
Dialogue: 0,0:08:42.10,0:08:45.23,def2,TODOU,0,0,0,,{\c&HEEEDB8&}{michi}We only received a mysterious transmission.
Dialogue: 0,0:08:45.23,0:08:47.84,def2,TODOU,0,0,0,,{\c&HEEEDB8&}{michi}Nothing's been confirmed yet.{certain yet.}
Dialogue: 0,0:08:48.94,0:08:51.80,def2,TODOU,0,0,0,,{\c&HEEEDB8&}{kimi}You're being too hasty.
Dialogue: 0,0:08:52.74,0:08:54.92,def2,TODOU,0,0,0,,{\c&HEEEDB8&}{yamato}The Yamato is a powerful weapon.
Dialogue: 0,0:08:55.48,0:09:02.08,def2,TODOU,0,0,0,,{\c&HEEEDB8&}{mishiranu}If you carelessly get involved in a conflict in\N an unknown place, that might endanger Earth.
Dialogue: 0,0:09:02.44,0:09:06.38,def2,TODOU,0,0,0,,{\c&HEEEDB8&}{sonna}Nobody wants that kind of future.
Dialogue: 0,0:09:07.02,0:09:08.76,def2,TODOU,0,0,0,,{\c&HEEEDB8&}{ima}It's not too late.{We still have time.}
Dialogue: 0,0:09:09.26,0:09:13.08,def2,TODOU,0,0,0,,{yamato}Hand over the Yamato,\N and surrender immediately.
Dialogue: 0,0:09:14.72,0:09:18.26,def2,TODOU,0,0,0,,{shokun}Everyone, be courageous and…
Dialogue: 0,0:09:19.42,0:09:21.70,def2,KODAI,0,0,0,,{\c&HEEEDB8&}Chief, Acting Captain Susumu Kodai here.
Dialogue: 0,0:09:27.20,0:09:28.86,def2,TODOU,0,0,0,,{\c&HEEEDB8&}I'll give you five minutes.
Dialogue: 0,0:09:31.78,0:09:33.72,def2,KODAI,0,0,0,,Everyone, listen carefully.
Dialogue: 0,0:09:34.18,0:09:35.82,def2,KODAI,0,0,0,,{\c&HEEEDB8&}You just heard the reality.
Dialogue: 0,0:09:36.70,0:09:40.98,def2,KODAI,0,0,0,,{\c&HEEEDB8&}What the Chief said was right. \NBut, the Yamato will depart as scheduled.
Dialogue: 0,0:09:41.86,0:09:45.88,def2,KODAI,0,0,0,,{\c&HEEEDB8&}We must go as long as\N there's someone who needs our help.
Dialogue: 0,0:09:46.66,0:09:51.53,def2,KODAI,0,0,0,,{\c&HEEEDB8&}{gimi}It's not out of a sense of responsibility, but because it's my hope for how the people of Earth should act.
Dialogue: 0,0:09:52.50,0:09:54.68,def2,KODAI,0,0,0,,Leave the ship if you are uncertain.
Dialogue: 0,0:09:55.50,0:09:58.24,def2,KODAI,0,0,0,,Whether you leave or stay, it’s up to you.
Dialogue: 0,0:10:02.74,0:10:05.98,def2,TOKUGAWA,0,0,0,,Acting Captain, you’re way too serious.
Dialogue: 0,0:10:06.94,0:10:08.36,def2,NANBU,0,0,0,,We all know what to do.
Dialogue: 0,0:10:08.96,0:10:11.74,def2,TOKUGAWA,0,0,0,,We lived under the same roof.
Dialogue: 0,0:10:12.78,0:10:15.20,def2,YAMAZAKI,0,0,0,,{\c&HEEEDB8&}This is the engine room. No one’s leaving.
Dialogue: 0,0:10:15.84,0:10:17.82,def2,MAN,0,0,0,,{\c&HEEEDB8&}No one’s leaving the tactical team.
Dialogue: 0,0:10:18.38,0:10:19.06,def2,NANBU,0,0,0,,Good.
Dialogue: 0,0:10:19.26,0:10:21.08,def2,NANBU,0,0,0,,{\c&HEEEDB8&}Logistics section, no one’s leaving.
Dialogue: 0,0:10:21.38,0:10:23.08,def2,WOMAN,0,0,0,,{\c&HEEEDB8&}Information section is good to go.
Dialogue: 0,0:10:23.58,0:10:26.14,def2,WOMAN,0,0,0,,{\c&HEEEDB8&}Tech section’s confirmed everyone’s wishes.
Dialogue: 0,0:10:28.14,0:10:29.38,def2,OHTA,0,0,0,,Navigation section…
Dialogue: 0,0:10:32.10,0:10:33.70,def2,OHTA,0,0,0,,Navigation section, everyone’s present.
Dialogue: 0,0:10:36.66,0:10:37.82,def2,KODAI,0,0,0,,Prepare for take off.
Dialogue: 0,0:10:38.82,0:10:40.60,def2,KODAI,0,0,0,,Ohta, I’ll steer the ship.
Dialogue: 0,0:10:40.90,0:10:42.74,def2,OHTA,0,0,0,,Don’t wreck it.
Dialogue: 0,0:10:47.42,0:10:48.98,def2,MAN,0,0,0,,The control room !
Dialogue: 0,0:10:49.54,0:10:51.60,def2,OHTA,0,0,0,,We can't access the dock's control system.
Dialogue: 0,0:10:52.18,0:10:53.78,def2,SANADA,0,0,0,,We can't inject water.
Dialogue: 0,0:11:10.30,0:11:13.00,def2,KODAI,0,0,0,,Close all the bottom hatches to block any access.
Dialogue: 0,0:11:15.66,0:11:17.32,def2,SANADA,0,0,0,,Acting Captain, what should we do ?
Dialogue: 0,0:11:18.10,0:11:19.72,def2,MAN,0,0,0,,Message from Engineer Yamazaki.
Dialogue: 0,0:11:20.08,0:11:21.08,def2,KODAI,0,0,0,,Put it on the main panel.
Dialogue: 0,0:11:21.94,0:11:24.04,def2,YAMAZAKI,0,0,0,,{\c&HEEEDB8&}The dock's main system was destroyed.
Dialogue: 0,0:11:24.46,0:11:28.64,def2,YAMAZAKI,0,0,0,,{\c&HEEEDB8&}Not only can we not inject water,\N but the gate and gantry locks are inoperable.
Dialogue: 0,0:11:29.20,0:11:37.58,def2,YAMAZAKI,0,0,0,,{\c&HEEEDB8&}But if the sub control room is intact, we can transfer control of the water and lock system to the Yamato.
Dialogue: 0,0:11:37.74,0:11:38.90,def2,KODAI,0,0,0,,That means…
Dialogue: 0,0:11:39.30,0:11:43.96,def2,SANADA,0,0,0,,Someone has to go there and \Nmanually activate and transfer the system.
Dialogue: 0,0:11:44.54,0:11:45.36,def2,YAMAZAKI,0,0,0,,That’s right.
Dialogue: 0,0:11:45.96,0:11:48.56,def2,SANADA,0,0,0,,Acting Captain, assemble a task force.
Dialogue: 0,0:11:51.08,0:11:52.98,def2,KODAI,0,0,0,,I understand, Mr. Yamazaki.
Dialogue: 0,0:11:52.98,0:11:56.92,def2,KODAI,0,0,0,,Take Hoshina and Kiryu, and go\N there to activate the sub system.
Dialogue: 0,0:11:57.30,0:11:58.00,def2,YAMAZAKI,0,0,0,,{\c&HEEEDB8&}Yes, sir !
Dialogue: 0,0:11:58.42,0:12:02.10,def2,YAMAZAKI,0,0,0,,Nanbu, I authorize the use of weapons.\NGive our task force support.
Dialogue: 0,0:12:02.10,0:12:02.68,def2,NANBU,0,0,0,,Okay.
Dialogue: 0,0:12:03.04,0:12:04.22,def2,KODAI,0,0,0,,Make sure you don’t hit anybody.
Dialogue: 0,0:12:04.22,0:12:05.62,def2,NANBU,0,0,0,,I know.
Dialogue: 0,0:12:07.62,0:12:09.26,def2,MAN,0,0,0,,Weapons are online ! Take cover !
Dialogue: 0,0:12:09.50,0:12:11.58,def2,KODAI,0,0,0,,Don’t damage the underground dock.
Dialogue: 0,0:12:11.58,0:12:12.98,def2,NANBU,0,0,0,,The power is minimum.
Dialogue: 0,0:12:14.56,0:12:16.54,def2,MAN,0,0,0,,It began shooting. Pull back.
Dialogue: 0,0:12:20.88,0:12:21.74,def2,MISAKI,0,0,0,,Be careful.
Dialogue: 0,0:12:21.92,0:12:22.60,def2,HOSHINA,0,0,0,,You bet.
Dialogue: 0,0:12:22.60,0:12:23.32,def2,YAMAZAKI,0,0,0,,Let’s go.
Dialogue: 0,0:12:30.34,0:12:32.46,def2,MAN,0,0,0,,Three crew members left the\N ship and are heading somewhere.
Dialogue: 0,0:12:32.74,0:12:34.16,def2,MAN,0,0,0,,Follow and capture them !
Dialogue: 0,0:12:45.02,0:12:45.96,def2,YAMAZAKI,0,0,0,,Right over there.
Dialogue: 0,0:12:52.50,0:12:53.44,def2,YAMAZAKI,0,0,0,,Hurry ! Go !
Dialogue: 0,0:12:58.86,0:13:02.02,def2,MAN,0,0,0,,They don’t seem to be escaping.\NThey fired back.
Dialogue: 0,0:13:05.16,0:13:05.88,def2,MISAKI,0,0,0,,Hoshina !
Dialogue: 0,0:13:05.88,0:13:07.02,def2,SAIJO,0,0,0,,Misaki, wait !
Dialogue: 0,0:13:11.16,0:13:12.36,def2,KIRYU,0,0,0,,It’s activated.
Dialogue: 0,0:13:12.36,0:13:14.84,def2,HOSHINA,0,0,0,,We can transfer control to the Yamato.
Dialogue: 0,0:13:29.40,0:13:30.60,def2,MAN,0,0,0,,Get out !
Dialogue: 0,0:13:32.20,0:13:36.06,def2,HOSHINA,0,0,0,,{\c&HEEEDB8&}This is Hoshina in the sub control room. \NWater system is activated.
Dialogue: 0,0:13:36.34,0:13:39.08,def2,KIRYU,0,0,0,,{\c&HEEEDB8&}I'm sending the control program to the Yamato.
Dialogue: 0,0:13:40.20,0:13:41.08,def2,OHTA,0,0,0,,Here it comes.
Dialogue: 0,0:13:41.36,0:13:43.68,def2,SANADA,0,0,0,,Control program transfer confirmed.
Dialogue: 0,0:13:51.78,0:13:53.16,def2,MAN,0,0,0,,Unable to secure the Yamato.
Dialogue: 0,0:13:53.58,0:13:54.98,def2,TOKUGAWA,0,0,0,,Starting the sub engine.
Dialogue: 0,0:13:57.82,0:14:00.66,def2,MAN,0,0,0,,They've started the launch sequence. \NEveryone, evacuate.
Dialogue: 0,0:14:01.34,0:14:03.62,def2,OHTA,0,0,0,,The water level is passing\N the side observation rooms.
Dialogue: 0,0:14:07.04,0:14:09.94,def2,KODAI,0,0,0,,Keep the hatch open.\N Don't close it until everyone's back.
Dialogue: 0,0:14:21.50,0:14:22.33,def2,KIRYU,0,0,0,,Let’s hurry.
Dialogue: 0,0:14:22.33,0:14:24.48,def2,KIRYU,0,0,0,,With the water rising at this rate, \Nwe won't be able to get back to the ship.
Dialogue: 0,0:14:28.12,0:14:30.86,def2,YAMAZAKI,0,0,0,,Don't move ! \NA few men are still over there !
Dialogue: 0,0:14:32.20,0:14:33.66,def2,HOSHINA,0,0,0,,Mr. Yamazaki, we don’t have time.
Dialogue: 0,0:14:33.90,0:14:34.72,def2,KIRYU,0,0,0,,Hoshina.
Dialogue: 0,0:14:35.34,0:14:37.02,def2,HOSHINA,0,0,0,,The water’s reached here.
Dialogue: 0,0:14:37.92,0:14:39.60,def2,KIRYU,0,0,0,,This floor isn't safe.{’s dangerous.}
Dialogue: 0,0:14:39.80,0:14:42.14,def2,MAN,0,0,0,,The water’s rising too fast.\N It’s dangerous here.
Dialogue: 0,0:14:42.74,0:14:43.70,def2,HOSHINA,0,0,0,,What should we do ?
Dialogue: 0,0:14:43.70,0:14:46.86,def2,KIRYU,0,0,0,,If they wait for us, the Yamato\N won’t be able to take off.
Dialogue: 0,0:14:47.22,0:14:48.16,def2,MISAKI,0,0,0,,Hoshina !
Dialogue: 0,0:14:49.42,0:14:51.02,def2,MISAKI,0,0,0,,Hoshina, this way !
Dialogue: 0,0:14:52.16,0:14:53.98,def2,ENOMOTO,0,0,0,,Saijo, are you okay ?
Dialogue: 0,0:14:53.98,0:14:55.98,def2,ENOMOTO,0,0,0,,It’s dangerous here. Get back.
Dialogue: 0,0:14:55.98,0:14:57.98,def2,SAIJO,0,0,0,,But Yamazaki and the others…
Dialogue: 0,0:14:57.98,0:15:01.52,def2,ENOMOTO,0,0,0,,We have to close this hatch.\N They can still use the upper one.
Dialogue: 0,0:15:01.82,0:15:04.32,def2,SAIJO,0,0,0,,Yamazaki, Hoshina, Kiryu…
Dialogue: 0,0:15:05.30,0:15:10.00,def2,OHTA,0,0,0,,Water level has reached the rear hatch. \NClosing the water tight doors.{blockage wall.}
Dialogue: 0,0:15:10.40,0:15:12.34,def2,SANADA,0,0,0,,Dispatch a retrieval team to the rear hatch.
Dialogue: 0,0:15:12.48,0:15:14.34,def2,HOSHINA,0,0,0,,{\c&HEEEDB8&}Please increase the water fill rate.
Dialogue: 0,0:15:15.32,0:15:21.40,def2,HOSHINA,0,0,0,,{\c&HEEEDB8&}Yamazaki, Kiryu, Misaki, and Hoshina\N will see the Yamato off from here.
Dialogue: 0,0:15:22.58,0:15:24.44,def2,KODAI,0,0,0,,Hoshina, Mr. Yamazaki…
Dialogue: 0,0:15:25.44,0:15:30.98,def2,YAMAZAKI,0,0,0,,I’m sure the Yamato will successfully \Ncomplete this journey without us.
Dialogue: 0,0:15:31.64,0:15:33.40,def2,YAMAZAKI,0,0,0,,We’ll wait for your safe return.
Dialogue: 0,0:15:33.98,0:15:40.88,def2,YAMAZAKI,0,0,0,,The four of us are proud to\N help start the Yamato's new journey.
Dialogue: 0,0:15:43.16,0:15:43.94,def2,KODAI,0,0,0,,Mr. Yamazaki…
Dialogue: 0,0:15:46.20,0:15:47.32,def2,KODAI,0,0,0,,Thank you.
Dialogue: 0,0:15:47.62,0:15:49.30,def2,OHTA,0,0,0,,Water level is passing the bridge.
Dialogue: 0,0:16:01.52,0:16:03.06,def2,SANADA,0,0,0,,Water injection complete.
Dialogue: 0,0:16:10.06,0:16:11.86,def2,KODAI,0,0,0,,Release the gantry locks.
Dialogue: 0,0:16:23.22,0:16:25.78,def2,KODAI,0,0,0,,All hands, maintain Class-1 battle stations.
Dialogue: 0,0:16:30.72,0:16:32.56,def2,KODAI,0,0,0,,Ahead slow, 0.5.
Dialogue: 0,0:16:33.22,0:16:35.38,def2,TOKUGAWA,0,0,0,,Ahead slow, 0.5.
Dialogue: 0,0:16:55.70,0:16:57.44,def2,KODAI,0,0,0,,Open the gate.
Dialogue: 0,0:17:29.16,0:17:31.70,def2,KODAI,0,0,0,,Yamato is entering the departure corridor.
Dialogue: 0,0:17:40.66,0:17:42.56,def2,MAN,0,0,0,,The Yamato has entered the sea.
Dialogue: 0,0:17:44.56,0:17:46.58,def2,SERIZAWA,0,0,0,,We have no other choice.
Dialogue: 0,0:17:46.58,0:17:49.10,def2,SERIZAWA,0,0,0,,Get the combat satellite ready for attack.
Dialogue: 0,0:17:55.46,0:17:58.20,def2,TOKUGAWA,0,0,0,,Send power to the wave motion engine.
Dialogue: 0,0:18:15.66,0:18:19.28,def2,KODAI,0,0,0,,Sub engine, increase from \Nsecond to third combat speed.
Dialogue: 0,0:18:19.28,0:18:21.38,def2,KODAI,0,0,0,,30 seconds until first space knot.
Dialogue: 0,0:18:26.32,0:18:27.02,def2,MAN,0,0,0,,Is he…
Dialogue: 0,0:18:29.26,0:18:33.28,def2,TOKUGAWA,0,0,0,,Wave motion engine cylinder safety valve open.
Dialogue: 0,0:18:33.28,0:18:36.08,def2,TOKUGAWA,0,0,0,,Five minutes until wave motion engine ignition.
Dialogue: 0,0:18:36.68,0:18:39.42,def2,KODAI,0,0,0,,{\c&HFFFFFF&}Shima, if only you were here…
Dialogue: 0,0:18:40.00,0:18:43.08,def2,TOKUGAWA,0,0,0,,Wave motion engine pressure rising.
Dialogue: 0,0:18:43.08,0:18:46.10,def2,TOKUGAWA,0,0,0,,Energy charge 90 percent.
Dialogue: 0,0:18:46.30,0:18:49.73,def2,SANADA,0,0,0,,As soon as we reach the surface, \Nignite the wave motion engine and climb.
Dialogue: 0,0:18:50.12,0:18:52.33,def2,KODAI,0,0,0,,Sub engine, maximum combat speed.
Dialogue: 0,0:18:52.33,0:18:55.42,def2,KODAI,0,0,0,,Elevation 40 degrees. \NTwo minutes to surface.
Dialogue: 0,0:18:55.96,0:19:01.40,def2,TOKUGAWA,0,0,0,,Wave motion engine pressure rising. \NEnergy charge 100 percent.
Dialogue: 0,0:19:11.26,0:19:14.26,def2,TOKUGAWA,0,0,0,,Two minutes until wave motion engine ignition.
Dialogue: 0,0:19:17.34,0:19:18.74,def2,SHIMA,0,0,0,,Well done, Kodai.
Dialogue: 0,0:19:19.58,0:19:20.30,def2,KODAI,0,0,0,,Shima.
Dialogue: 0,0:19:20.58,0:19:21.46,def2,SHIMA,0,0,0,,Sorry for being late.
Dialogue: 0,0:19:22.18,0:19:23.26,def2,OHTA,0,0,0,,Shima…
Dialogue: 0,0:19:23.36,0:19:24.20,def2,AIHARA,0,0,0,,Shima.
Dialogue: 0,0:19:25.24,0:19:26.60,def2,SHIMA,0,0,0,,We’ll talk later.
Dialogue: 0,0:19:30.42,0:19:32.98,def2,TOKUGAWA,0,0,0,,Ten seconds until flywheel activation.
Dialogue: 0,0:19:35.58,0:19:40.03,def2,SHIMA,0,0,0,,One minute to surface. \NCurrent sub engine output is maximum.
Dialogue: 0,0:19:42.54,0:19:47.08,def2,TOKUGAWA,0,0,0,,Wave motion engine energy charge 120 percent.
Dialogue: 0,0:19:47.08,0:19:48.82,def2,TOKUGAWA,0,0,0,,Activating flywheel.
Dialogue: 0,0:19:49.32,0:19:50.33,def2,SHIMA,0,0,0,,Activating flywheel.
Dialogue: 0,0:19:54.96,0:19:57.28,def2,SHIMA,0,0,0,,Ten seconds until wave motion engine ignition.
Dialogue: 0,0:20:02.28,0:20:02.86,def2,SHIMA,0,0,0,,Five…
Dialogue: 0,0:20:03.46,0:20:03.96,def2,SHIMA,0,0,0,,Four…
Dialogue: 0,0:20:04.58,0:20:05.02,def2,SHIMA,0,0,0,,Three…
Dialogue: 0,0:20:05.84,0:20:06.46,def2,SHIMA,0,0,0,,Two…
Dialogue: 0,0:20:06.86,0:20:07.68,def2,SHIMA,0,0,0,,One…
Dialogue: 0,0:20:08.08,0:20:10.40,def2,SHIMA,0,0,0,,Engaging flywheel for ignition.
Dialogue: 0,0:20:14.90,0:20:16.56,def2,KODAI,0,0,0,,Yamato, take off.
Dialogue: 0,0:20:38.44,0:20:40.90,def2,SHIMA,0,0,0,,Elevation 20 degrees. All systems{ship}, nominal.
Dialogue: 0,0:20:41.92,0:20:44.48,def2,SHIMA,0,0,0,,Deploy wings for atmospheric flight.
Dialogue: 0,0:21:10.50,0:21:13.18,def2,SAIJO,0,0,0,,Seven thermo-nuclear reactions at 1 o’clock.
Dialogue: 0,0:21:13.18,0:21:16.32,def2,SAIJO,0,0,0,,Distance 5600km, elevation 27.
Dialogue: 0,0:21:16.32,0:21:18.80,def2,KODAI,0,0,0,,Nanbu, get main turrets 1 and 2 ready.
Dialogue: 0,0:21:19.20,0:21:22.68,def2,NANBU,0,0,0,,Seven targets, trajectory input complete. \NMain turrets ready to fire.
Dialogue: 0,0:21:24.58,0:21:25.64,def2,KODAI,0,0,0,,Fire !
Dialogue: 0,0:21:58.66,0:22:00.38,def2,TODOU,0,0,0,,{\c&HFFFFFF&}Okita’s children are leaving.
Dialogue: 0,0:22:01.06,0:22:04.08,def2,SERIZAWA,0,0,0,,That's it. They've crossed the line.
Dialogue: 0,0:22:04.56,0:22:08.86,def2,SERIZAWA,0,0,0,,I’ll stop the Yamato for the honor{credibility}\N of the Earth Defense Force.
Dialogue: 0,0:22:37.58,0:22:44.87,Karaoke Translation op,TEXT,0,0,0,,{\3c&H000000&\pos(212,874)}Episode 4
Dialogue: 0,0:22:37.58,0:22:44.87,Karaoke Translation op,TEXT,0,0,0,,{\3c&H000000&\pos(324,1044)}Take off for the Unknown!
Dialogue: 0,0:22:53.78,0:23:05.80,def2,ENDSONG,0,0,0,,{\i1\c&HFFFFFF&}Tawamureru yuragu tsuki no kagami
Dialogue: 0,0:22:53.78,0:23:05.80,def2,ENDSONG,0,0,0,,{\c&HFFFFFF&}The reflection of the moon is blurry and capricious
Dialogue: 0,0:23:05.80,0:23:17.20,def2,ENDSONG,0,0,0,,{\i1\c&HFFFFFF&}Kokoro tokasu yuubina kami no itazura
Dialogue: 0,0:23:05.80,0:23:17.20,def2,ENDSONG,0,0,0,,{\c&HFFFFFF&}Graceful God's mischief mesmerizes my heart
Dialogue: 0,0:23:17.20,0:23:28.48,def2,ENDSONG,0,0,0,,{\i1\c&HFFFFFF&}Uchi ni himeta awai omoide ni
Dialogue: 0,0:23:17.20,0:23:28.48,def2,ENDSONG,0,0,0,,{\c&HFFFFFF&}There's a faint memory hidden within{inside}
Dialogue: 0,0:23:28.48,0:23:41.08,def2,ENDSONG,0,0,0,,{\i1\c&HFFFFFF&}Iki wo fukikomu no michite yukumade
Dialogue: 0,0:23:28.48,0:23:41.08,def2,ENDSONG,0,0,0,,{\c&HFFFFFF&}Breathe life into it until it's full
Dialogue: 0,0:23:41.08,0:23:52.68,def2,ENDSONG,0,0,0,,{\i1\c&HFFFFFF&}Hibiku anata no mune no kodou wo
Dialogue: 0,0:23:41.08,0:23:52.68,def2,ENDSONG,0,0,0,,{\c&HFFFFFF&}I hear a heartbeat echoing through
Dialogue: 0,0:23:52.68,0:24:03.23,def2,ENDSONG,0,0,0,,{\i1\c&HFFFFFF&}Watashi hitori janai
Dialogue: 0,0:23:52.68,0:24:03.23,def2,ENDSONG,0,0,0,,{\c&HFFFFFF&}I am not alone
Dialogue: 0,0:24:03.43,0:24:15.08,def2,endsong,0,0,0,,{\i1\c&HFFFFFF&}Saewataru sora ni inori
Dialogue: 0,0:24:03.43,0:24:15.08,def2,endsong,0,0,0,,{\c&HFFFFFF&}I pray to the wide open sky
Dialogue: 0,0:24:15.68,0:24:39.38,def2,ENDSONG,0,0,0,,{\i1\c&HFFFFFF&}Atarashii ichinichi no maku ga aketeyuku
Dialogue: 0,0:24:15.68,0:24:39.38,def2,ENDSONG,0,0,0,,{\c&HFFFFFF&}The curtain opens on a brand new day
