Dialogue: 0,0:23:04.53,0:23:13.38,Karaoke Translation op,CAST2,0,0,0,,{\3c&H000000&\a5\pos(1248,144)}Uchida Aya\NMoriya Satomi\NIse Fumihide\NTakagi Motoki\NKijima Ryuichi\NSunseki Kazuhiro\NKasai Kengo\NTorita Yuji\NSugao Takayuki{ Sugaara}\NGenda Tessho\NKojima Toshihiko\NFujinuma Kento\NYano Masaaki \NNokubi Naoko
Dialogue: 0,0:24:54.13,0:24:55.58,def2,TEXT,0,0,0,,{\c&HFFFFFF&\pos(970,662)}Preview
Dialogue: 0,0:24:55.80,0:24:59.16,def2,SERIZAWA,0,0,0,,I'll secure the Yamato no matter{ what} the outcome.{ will be.}
Dialogue: 0,0:24:59.16,0:25:00.98,def2,KODAI,0,0,0,,They’re coming ! Class-1 battle stations !
Dialogue: 0,0:25:00.98,0:25:02.28,def2,SHIMA,0,0,0,,Please hold on.
Dialogue: 0,0:25:02.28,0:25:03.34,def2,TOKUGAWA,0,0,0,,Release camouflage.
Dialogue: 0,0:25:03.34,0:25:03.96,def2,KODAI,0,0,0,,Fire !
Dialogue: 0,0:25:03.96,0:25:05.96,def2,SANADA,0,0,0,,Side depth-charge launchers, get ready.
Dialogue: 0,0:25:05.96,0:25:08.26,def2,SAIJO,0,0,0,,Contact with the Andromeda in ten seconds !
Dialogue: 0,0:25:08.08,0:25:09.03,Karaoke Translation op,TEXT,0,0,0,,{\3c&H000000&\fscx135\fscy103\pos(964,462)}Episode 05
